    "https://employment.unl.edu/postings/102010": {
      "title": "Director of Career Development & Leadership",
      "description": "University of Nebraska-Lincoln | Director of Career Development &amp; Leadership Skip to Main Content University of Nebraska-Lincoln Employment Website Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Director of Career Development & Leadership Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. Click on “Apply for this Job”. You will then either create an application or edit your current application that is on file. You will be required to attach your resume, cover letter, and list of references as three (3) separate documents in MS Word or PDF format. Position Information Position Information Eeo Statement Working Title Director of Career Development & Leadership Department Athletics-0850 Requisition Number S_260669 Posting Open Date 08/18/2026 Application Review Date: (To ensure consideration, please submit all application materials before review date) 08/26/2026 Posting Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Description of Work Provide student-athletes with life skills guidance, program assistance and total person development for Nebraska Athletics. Meet with prospective student-athletes and families on regular basis. Coordinate, monitor and document various outreach events and student-athlete appearances in compliance with NCAA and conference rules. Plan, organize, and direct multiple major life skills events and seminars. Serve as advisor to leadership groups. Meet with individual student-athletes for career development. Coordination of various seminars, workshops and special functions. Evening hours and weekends required. The University of Nebraska does not discriminate based on race, color, ethnicity, national origin, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender identity, religion, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, and/or political affiliation in its programs, activities, or employment. See https://equity.unl.edu/notice-nondiscrimination/ . 